<div class="card">
    <h2>Step 4: Age Exemption Check</h2>
    <p class="form-hint">Patients under 16, 16-18 in full-time education, or aged 60+ are already entitled to free NHS prescriptions on age grounds and do not need FP92A.</p>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label for="patientFullTimeEducation">Patient is 16-18 and in full-time education?</label>
        <select id="patientFullTimeEducation" name="patientFullTimeEducation">
            <option value="" {% if patient.fullTimeEducation == "" %}selected{% endif %}>&mdash;</option>
            <option value="no" {% if patient.fullTimeEducation == "no" %}selected{% endif %}>No</option>
            <option value="yes" {% if patient.fullTimeEducation == "yes" %}selected{% endif %}>Yes</option>
        </select>
    </div>
</div>
